The mesh files in this directory (*.bin) and the geometry in heart-meshes.json are
derived from BodyParts3D.

  BodyParts3D, Copyright (C) The Database Center for Life Science
  licensed under CC Attribution-Share Alike 2.1 Japan
  https://dbarchive.biosciencedbc.jp/en/bodyparts3d/
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.1/jp/deed.en

They have been modified: only the heart structures were extracted, they were
registered into this project's cardiac coordinate frame, uniformly scaled to
centimetres, and decimated by vertex clustering. As adaptations they are
distributed under the same CC BY-SA 2.1 Japan licence.

Regenerate with:  python3 tools/build_heart_meshes.py

The rest of the site (HTML, CSS, JavaScript) is a separate work that loads these
files; it is not itself an adaptation of them.
